      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "Diagram Design, the skill.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A white screen with high-contrast, minimalist UI elements. At the center is a black rounded square labeled 'diagram-design Skill' with a white and orange icon representing a flowchart. To the left is a blue icon for 'Codex', and to the right, an orange starburst icon for 'Claude Code'. Dashed lines connect the outer icons to the central 'Skill' box. The lighting is perfectly flat and artificial, creating a clean, digital aesthetic. The background is a solid, bright white with a soft drop shadow behind the central icon.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "timestamp_end": "0:01",
          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Specifically for turning text into diagrams.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A clean, white pop-up window appears on a plain background. It contains several lines of Chinese text outlining a website workflow. The text describes a sequence starting from a reader opening a website, through Cloudflare caching, Astro rendering, to content being read from a CMS. The font is a modern, sans-serif black with a soft grey border around the window.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:01"
        },
        {
          "audio": "You can tell it...",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A complex, professionally styled architecture diagram is shown on a dark background. The diagram features interconnected nodes labeled 'Reader', 'Cloudflare', 'Astro', and 'CMS' with various sub-components like 'MDX Bundle' and 'Astro Origin'. The nodes are black with white text, and lines have arrows indicating data flow. The color palette is dark grey, white, and hints of orange for the 'Astro' logo. The layout is perfectly aligned and minimalist.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 3,
          "timestamp_end": "0:03",
          "timestamp_start": "0:02"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Hey, help me draw an architecture diagram for this application.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "A dark, grid-patterned terminal interface titled 'AGENT SESSION' is shown. A blinking cursor types out the prompt: '> make me an architecture diagram of my app'. The lighting is dim with a neon-orange accent in the top corner. The text is white, monospaced font. A subtle handheld-style jitter adds a sense of organic interaction.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 4,
          "timestamp_end": "0:05",
          "timestamp_start": "0:03"
        },
        {
          "audio": "It can produce a structural diagram with a clean layout and zero 'country' vibes.",
          "label": "Real Experience",
          "visual": "The camera pans slowly across the final architecture diagram generated in Scene 3. The focus is on the crisp, clean lines and the professional layout. The lighting is uniform across the digital surface. The colors are highly saturated against the dark background, emphasizing the 'Content CMS' and 'Astro Origin' sections.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 5,
          "timestamp_end": "0:07",
          "timestamp_start": "0:05"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Clean layout, zero 'country' vibes.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A dark screen with a purple and white banner featuring large Chinese characters. The background is slightly blurred, suggesting a transition. The lighting is soft and diffuse, highlighting the central text block.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 6,
          "timestamp_end": "0:08",
          "timestamp_start": "0:07"
        },
        {
          "audio": "A total of 44 types of diagrams.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A grid display shows 31 out of 44 different diagram types. The screen is dark grey, and each thumbnail shows a unique diagram style: 'ARCHITECTURE', 'SEQUENCE', 'QUADRANT', etc. The camera is static. The thumbnails are monochromatic with white lines, creating a technical, catalog-like look.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 7,
          "timestamp_end": "0:10",
          "timestamp_start": "0:08"
        },
        {
          "audio": "The official website has an even more exaggerated example.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A white screen featuring a 3D isometric line-art illustration of a modern smartphone. The drawing is clean with thin grey lines and a dark screen. The phone is positioned diagonally in the frame. The lighting is bright and even, simulating a professional design workspace.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 8,
          "timestamp_end": "0:11",
          "timestamp_start": "0:10"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Disassembling a phone layer by layer, with every layer labeled clearly.",
          "label": "Problem Solving",
          "visual": "The 3D smartphone illustration begins an exploded-view animation. The top display layer lifts off, followed by internal components like the 'Logic board', 'Battery', and the chassis. Red callout lines appear, labeling each component in a clean, sans-serif font. The movement is smooth and synchronized. The background remains a sterile, solid white.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 9,
          "timestamp_end": "0:14",
          "timestamp_start": "0:11"
        },
        {
